Hide
Type "source /root/kit/env.sh && cd /root/godot-project && lilbee status"
Enter
Sleep 3s
Type "clear && lilbee launch opencode --mcp --yes"
Enter
Sleep __BOOT__s
Show
Sleep 3s
Type@40ms "make a procedural level generator that places wall and floor tiles and scatters collectibles using pathfinding. write everything in a single file and save it as level_generator.gd"
Sleep 800ms
Enter
Sleep __GEN__s
Sleep 2s
Screenshot __REEL__.png
Ctrl+C
Sleep 1s
Type "cat level_generator.gd"
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 5s
